# Shared CDN prefixes for THIS assignment. Reachable only through the relay,
# never directly from the lab (the kernel drops @lab_net -> @cdn_edge and logs
# ARTEX-CDN-DIRECT).
#
# Populate only from the vendor's published list, only for CDNs the client's names
# actually sit behind, and only when a tool ignoring HTTP_PROXY must still work.
# Prefer adding names to scope_domains in proxy/squid.conf: a name survives IP
# rotation and is narrower by construction.
#
# Cloudflare: https://www.cloudflare.com/ips-v4
# Fastly:     https://api.fastly.com/public-ip-list
